# Text Analyzer API Tests
# Run these requests in Visual Studio or with the REST Client extension

### Analyze text endpoint
POST http://localhost:5028/tfc-analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello world this is a test"
}

###

### Sentiment analysis endpoint
POST http://localhost:5028/tfc-sentiment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "This is a wonderful day"
}

###

### Test with empty text (should return error)
POST http://localhost:5028/tfc-analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": ""
}

###

### Test with null text (should return error)
POST http://localhost:5028/tfc-analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": null
}